\ Not supported yet (plan row TB2, small tactics 1): funext on a function
\ of two arguments, whose apply funext needs ?β x =?= Nat → Nat, which
\ LeanForth's unifier does not settle yet (93, exit 2); Lean accepts.
\ Lean: theorem u_funext_add : Nat.add = Nat.add := by
\         funext x y
\         rfl
theorem u_funext_add
  ' Nat.add ' Nat.add =
:= by
  by-funext[ x y ]
  by-rfl
end u_funext_add
